BODY = [
("p", "Rachel Scott is American Womenswear Designer of the Year for the second time. The founder of Diotima won the award at the 2026 CFDA Fashion Awards, held on Monday 2 November at the American Museum of Natural History in New York. She first won it in 2024."),
("p", "Scott was born in Jamaica, and her work at Diotima draws on traditional Jamaican craft techniques. She also leads Proenza Schouler as creative director while continuing to run her own label."),
("h2", "The winners", "The rest of the ", "night"),
("p", "Ralph Lauren was named American Menswear Designer of the Year, a year after winning the womenswear award. Ana Khouri took American Accessory Designer of the Year, and Colleen Allen won American Emerging Designer of the Year."),
("p", "Anthony Vaccarello was named International Designer of the Year, an award that marks his decade as creative director of Saint Laurent. His departure from the house was announced this autumn."),
("h2", "The honorees", "Lifetime and ", "beyond"),
("p", "The photographers Inez van Lamsweerde and Vinoodh Matadin received the Geoffrey Beene Lifetime Achievement Award. Tory Burch was given the Positive Change Award, the architect Peter Marino the Fashion Icon Award, and Linda Fargo the Founder’s Award. Eva Chen received the Media Award, Susan Cianciolo the Isabel Toledo Board of Directors’ Tribute, and Gap Inc. the Innovation Award."),
]

